# Shared color palette for lean/RSI badges across all stock report HTML
# (ops/stock_day_range.py, ops/stock_technicals.py). Loaded once by
# stock_fundamentals.py's load_palette() and reused everywhere via
# `import stock_fundamentals as sf; sf.PALETTE[...]`. Owner-edited, committed
# -- no secrets, same trust model as ops/workflows.json/ops/macros.json.
#
# Edit a value here to change the color everywhere; no code changes needed.

